{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent nonauthor merged-SHA review receipt, part 4/6 (24 rows; 142 total). Reviewer session: resume-group03-20261023. Immutable before: b65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd. Reviewed signed candidate: b46efb88356c0d78ee726007b12a62d4feae6ffe. Exact Gerrit 3096 merged SHA: 5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89. All 28 grouped changed path blobs, including generated docs/env-vars.md, are byte-identical candidate→merged. Every selected row has directives, semantic preservation, and bloat removal PASS with a strict word reduction. Complete 142-row TSV SHA-256: 02e042abbe56804e72d174b1f2b63f9a826f37affa92238e25552c9aef9ec1e9.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.post_vote@304-317\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:304-317\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:241-244\tPost LLM-Review with the autogenerated tag, no notification, and a patchset-level robot comment. Add ordinary inline comments only when provided. Raise GerritError on non-2xx so failed publication writes no dedup row.\tPASS\t132\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.get_change_messages@349-354\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:349-354\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:276-277\tReturn change messages in Gerrit order. Scan their lines for verdict tags because Gerrit prepends a Patch Set header.\tPASS\t62\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.post_comment@359-365\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:359-365\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:282-283\tPost a change message with no labels member, so a retrigger reply cannot alter or copy vote state.\tPASS\t70\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.list_events@411-421\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:411-421\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:329-330\tRead newline-delimited events from the slash-terminated events-log endpoint. Optional since maps to Gerrit's inclusive t1 window.\tPASS\t94\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.clone_change_ref@439-444\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:439-444\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:348-351\tFetch the patchset ref into a disposable checkout and return its path. Use HTTPS bot credentials, bounded git calls, and a stall abort on network fetches. Fetch the tickets branch from its mirror for attested review. Redact credentials from failures.\tPASS\t55\t40\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::C:GerritClient.clone_change_ref@489-496\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:489-496\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:396-398\tFetch the orphan tickets branch from the GitHub mirror as origin/tickets. The attested gate needs its current tree. Gerrit hosts only code refs. Depth 1 is enough for materialization.\tPASS\t105\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::C:GerritClient.clone_change_ref@523-525\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:523-525\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:425-426\tConvert git timeouts through the same credential redaction as other fetch failures. Timeout arguments can contain the tokenized URL.\tPASS\t35\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::C:GerritClient.clone_change_ref@533-535\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:533-535\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:434-434\tRedact both raw and percent-encoded tokens from git failures.\tPASS\t38\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient._redact@544-546\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:544-546\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:443-443\tRemove raw and URL-encoded bot tokens from git error text.\tPASS\t35\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py::D:module@1-27\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:1-27\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:1-4\tCheck scratch availability and free space before cloning a review. Both an unmounted declared scratch volume and a low free-space floor use the low-disk coverage reason. Retry while budget remains, then defer without changing the Gerrit vote.\tPASS\t269\t37\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py::D:scratch_unavailable_detail@76-84\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:76-84\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:53-54\tAsk the shared gate-admission predicate whether dedicated scratch is mounted. Import it only when admission runs.\tPASS\t76\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py::D:scratch_coverage@91-96\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:91-96\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:61-62\tReturn a low-disk coverage block with the unmounted-volume detail. The shared reason keeps voter routing unchanged.\tPASS\t40\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py::D:pre_clone_refusal@120-126\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:120-126\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:86-88\tCheck the declared mount before the free-space floor. An unmounted path may appear writable and pass the floor. Return a refusal for either disk condition, or None to permit the clone.\tPASS\t54\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py::D:review_clone_has_room@140-145\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:140-145\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:102-103\tCheck the clone target's configured free-space floor. Accept config for the voter's patchable call signature.\tPASS\t44\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::D:module@1-51\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:1-51\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:1-7\tBackfill review votes lost with Gerrit webhooks. Poll events-log for the project's current vote-less revisions and use the same single-flight voter as webhooks. Persist an inclusive event-time cursor. Hold it at the oldest retryable candidate, bounded by the configured ceiling, so a failed review remains reachable. Vote and dedup checks prevent duplicate votes. On events-log failure, keep the cursor and vote state unchanged and emit RECONCILE_DEGRADED.\tPASS\t523\t66\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::C:module@75-88\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:75-88\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:31-33\tError and deferred results still owe a vote, so hold the cursor. Completed votes, irrelevant events, existing votes, and closed changes are terminal and let it advance.\tPASS\t131\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::C:module@91-105\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:91-105\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:36-38\tA module-wide bool requests cooperative shutdown without binding to one event loop. It stops new candidates and lets lifespan await the current backfill review under the queue's drain deadline.\tPASS\t170\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::D:_degraded@148-153\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:148-153\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:81-82\tEmit one greppable RECONCILE_DEGRADED stderr marker plus a structured log body, without duplicating the marker.\tPASS\t64\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::D:_write_cursor@172-179\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:172-179\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:101-102\tAtomically replace the cursor through a unique same-directory temp. Log write failures and let the next pass safely rescan.\tPASS\t80\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::D:_candidate_events@211-219\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:211-219\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:134-135\tKeep each change's latest patchset-bearing event for this project. Carry eventCreatedOn for cursor holdback without affecting voter parsing.\tPASS\t83\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::C:_candidate_events@228-232\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:228-232\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:144-145\tSkip closed changes that cannot receive votes. Missing status metadata proceeds so a votable change is not lost.\tPASS\t68\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::D:reconcile_once@268-278\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:268-278\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:181-184\tReview current vote-less candidates since the persisted cursor. Return scanned and reviewed counts. Hold the inclusive cursor at the oldest retryable abandonment, within the configured ceiling. On events-log failure, emit degradation and neither vote nor advance.\tPASS\t111\t36\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::C:reconcile_once@307-309\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:307-309\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:213-214\tTrack event times of retryably unvoted candidates. Their minimum keeps the next inclusive fetch window open.\tPASS\t40\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py::C:reconcile_once@313-323\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:313-323\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:218-219\tStop taking candidates during shutdown and hold each unvoted event behind the cursor. The next startup pass can retry them.\tPASS\t124\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792822759394465286,"uuid":"16b120d2-5666-4415-a922-da0c8ada5733"}